#: data/maps/RustboroCity_Mart/scripts.inc:67
msgctxt "RustboroCity_Mart_Text_BuyingHealsInCaseOfShroomish"
msgid ""
"I'm buying some PARLYZ HEALS and\n"
"ANTIDOTES.\p"
"Just in case I run into SHROOMISH\n"
"in PETALBURG WOODS.$"
msgstr ""
"我要买一些解麻药\n"
"和解毒药。\p"
"以防在橙华森林里\n"
"碰到蘑蘑菇。$"

#: data/maps/RustboroCity_Mart/scripts.inc:73
msgctxt "RustboroCity_Mart_Text_ShouldBuySuperPotionsInstead"
msgid ""
"My POKéMON evolved.\n"
"It has a lot of HP now.\p"
"I should buy SUPER POTIONS for it\n"
"instead of ordinary POTIONS.$"
msgstr ""
"我的宝可梦进化了。\n"
"现在它的HP很多。\p"
"我应该给它买好伤药，\n"
"而不是普通的伤药。$"

#: data/maps/RustboroCity_Mart/scripts.inc:79
msgctxt "RustboroCity_Mart_Text_GettingEscapeRopeJustInCase"
msgid ""
"I'm getting an ESCAPE ROPE just in\n"
"case I get lost in a cave.\p"
"I just need to use it to get back to\n"
"the entrance.$"
msgstr ""
"我要买一根离洞绳，\n"
"以防在洞窟里迷路。\p"
"只要用了它，\n"
"就能回到洞窟的入口。$"
